graph TD
    User([User asks question]) --> Query[Condense Query & Search PGVector]
    Query --> Fetch[Fetch chunks & distances]
    Fetch --> CalcConf[Calculate Confidence Score]
    
    CalcConf --> Choice{Confidence Score}
    
    Choice -->|< 0.60| Refuse[Create Message status: PUBLISHED <br/> content: 'I couldn't find enough information...']
    Refuse --> UserUI[Show response in Chat UI]

    Choice -->|>= 0.85| LLMGen[Generate Answer with Gemini]
    LLMGen --> AutoPub[Create Message status: PUBLISHED <br/> content: LLM response]
    AutoPub --> UserUI

    Choice -->|0.60 to 0.84| LLMGenReview[Generate Draft Answer with Gemini]
    LLMGenReview --> ReviewMsg[Create Message status: PENDING_REVIEW <br/> content: LLM Draft]
    ReviewMsg --> CreateTask[Create ReviewTask in MongoDB]
    CreateTask --> UserPending[Show 'Under Review' skeleton in User Chat]
    
    CreateTask -.->|Expose in Queue| RevUI[Reviewer Workspace /reviews]
    RevUI -->|Reviewer approves/edits| RevAction[Update ReviewTask status & finalAnswer]
    RevAction --> PublishMsg[Update Message status to PUBLISHED <br/> & set content = finalAnswer]
    PublishMsg -.->|Websocket / SSE / Polling| UserUI
